        \n\nTo connect, replace "Headphones_Name" with the exact name of your paired Bluetooth device:
    </string>
    <string name="instructions_header">ADB Usage:</string>
    <string name="adb_example">
        $ adb shell am broadcast \
        \n    -a com.esh.btcontrol.ACTION_CONNECT \
        \n    -n com.esh.btcontrol/.BluetoothControlReceiver \
        \n    -e name "Headphones_Name"
